# Prettier formats only the website stylesheet (frontend/src/styles.css, settings in
# frontend/.prettierrc.json). Everything else is ignored: the TypeScript and TSX code follows the
# project's own style (CLAUDE.md: single quotes, no semicolons), which Prettier's defaults would
# rewrite. This file sits at the repository root because editors (e.g. VS Code's Prettier extension)
# read the ignore file from the workspace root, so it also stops format-on-save touching other files.
/*
!/frontend/
/frontend/*
!/frontend/src/
/frontend/src/*
!/frontend/src/styles.css
